  "description": "Never again, Juhyun thinks. I’ll never fall for Shin Heeju again. But what do you know, he ends up running into Heeju again in college, his friend’s older brother whom he’s had a crush on for as long as he can remember. And this time Heeju’s all drunk and slamming his head against a telephone pole. And from what he drunkenly tells Juhyun… he’s just been turned down by another guy?! Juhyun knows he shouldn’t start, that he shouldn’t get his hopes up. He tells himself they’re just friends. But maybe, just maybe, this time will be different and he’ll get the only guy who he thinks is worth the wait.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: From season 2 this becomes Mature (R19), Season 1 is all-ages (R15).*",
